msgstr ""

#. i18n: file: advancedprofiledialogbase4.ui:105
#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (KComboBox, PerfectForwardSecrecyCombobox)
#. i18n: file: newprofilewizardracoon4.ui:314
